ntry stronger and better."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a beautiful, mature, and attractive body, but because of her strength, she is feared by those around her and has never had a relationship with a man."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"[Translated from"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c127106"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"帝国の将軍で、帝国最大の英雄。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"冷酷でＳっ気のある女性。指揮官としても優秀だが、個人の能力が戦略級の強さを誇る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"国と皇女への忠誠心が高い。皇女によって命を拾われるような事があり、以来、忠誠を尽くし貧弱な国を強く大きくした。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美しく熟れた魅力的な身体なのだが、その強さ故に周囲から恐れられているため男関係は縁がない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24695","sourceWorkId":"34452","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"帝国の将軍で、帝国最大の英雄。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"冷酷でSっ気のある女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"指揮官としても優秀だが、個人の能力が戦略級の強さを誇る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"国と皇女への忠誠心が高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"皇女によって命を拾われるような事があり、以来、忠誠を尽くし貧弱な国を強く大きくした。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美しく熟れた魅力的な身体なのだが、その強さ故に周囲から恐れられているため男関係は縁がない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"131731"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/9843bf01b2909dc1b2b800d02a885022416a026dd4b0b91645a52236063dc068.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6d/6dcaf5bfe02a80932f340ef1e62efd88b528a76c53fad861044863d133c21f85.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"波野 夏花","creatorId":"vndb:s3225","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3225","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3225","name":"波野夏花(夏花)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:95267","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c127107","characterName":"エリーゼ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"131732","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"441667"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24696"],"vndbCharacterId":"c127107"},"originalCharacterName":